+# gitleaks findings to ignore, by fingerprint: one `<commit>:<file>:<rule-id>:<line>` per line, as
+# gitleaks prints it with each finding. gitleaks reads this file from the repository root, in CI's
+# gitleaks job, the pre-commit hook and a local `gitleaks git .`.
