+# rotated, or a placeholder in an old commit. Say why above each entry. A value that is provably
+# not a credential, wherever it appears, belongs in .gitleaks.toml's allowlist instead, and a live
+# secret is rotated, never listed here. The template has no history findings, so this lists none.
